= retire-deletes-a-live-venv-from-a-scratch-prefix
f indicator/setup.sh
t mux-indicator-setup
# bt-sane's INCIDENT, in the function this package shares the shape with:
# `OLD_VENV` ignores PREFIX because the old path never had one, so a
# verification run that builds a venv in a throwaway prefix satisfies the
# "the new one works" check above and then deletes the real `~/.venvs/<pkg>`.
# It happened mid-verification on 2026-10-01.
#
# THE GATE IS THE LITERAL REAL PATH on purpose: a comparison against
# `${XDG_DATA_HOME:-...}` is no gate at all, because a verification run
# overrides that too, which was this fix's own first version.
-   "$HOME"/.local/share/mux/venv) ;;
+   *) ;;
