= class-transition-not-logged
f libexec/mux-agent
t mux-agent
# FOR THE RELAX DIRECTION THE LOG IS THE GATE'S VALUE, which is why this is
# guarded rather than treated as a nicety: the check itself is organisational,
# so the record of a change having happened is the part that survives somebody
# working around it. `_mux-partition-security.md` carries the open half of
# this (the log is the agent's own file, so it can erase its own tracks).
-     mux_log agent "$_clsess $_mk $_was -> $_mv via class"
+     :
